Glitch Field is one of the field effects present in Rejuvenation. It is classified as a Synthetic field and can be found during the Johto Virtual League battles and against [[Saki]] and [[Venam]] at Terajuma Beach

==Transitions From Other Fields==

* This field is generated if the moves Conversion and Conversion 2 are used one after the other in a battle if none of the users is holding an Everstone. The two moves can be any number of turns apart, as long the active field is not changed in those turns. The field lasts for 5 turns (8 turns if the user of the second move holds an Amplifield Rock). 
** ''Some rogue data remains...''
