==General Effects==

* The physical/special move split is undone.
* During damage calculation, both the Special Attack and Special Defense of a Pokémon are taken as equal to whichever of the two is higher (with stat stage/item modifiers taken into account).
* Fairy-type attacks become Normal-type.
* Critical hit rate is boosted by 1 stage if the attacker's unmodified speed stat is higher than its target's.
* Psychic-type moves increase in base power by 1.2x.
** ''.0P pl$ nerf!-//''

===Type chart alterations===

* Dragon-type moves always deal neutral damage.
* Bug-type moves hit Poison-types super-effectively.
* Poison-type moves hit Bug-types super-effectively.
* Ice-type moves hit Fire-types neutrally.
* Psychic-types are immune to Ghost-type moves.
* Steel-types are resistant to Ghost and Dark-type moves.

