==Moves Affected==

* Moves with a recharge turn do not need to recharge if they KO the target.
* Blizzard's accuracy is increased to 90%.
* Explosion and Self-Destruct additionally halve the target's Defense when calculating damage.
* Metronome never calls moves with less than 70 base power.
* Rage locks the user into the move indefinitely.
* Rest works normally when called by Sleep Talk.
* Roar and Whirlwind fail on use.
